---
title: Cinnamon Brown Sugar Cream Cheese
source: https://www.theharvestkitchen.com/cinnamon-raisin-cream-cheese-spread/
image: https://www.theharvestkitchen.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/recipe-for-cream-cheese-spread-650x975.jpg
---

Combine @cream cheese or mascarpone{8%oz}(softened), @brown sugar{2%tbsp}, @cinnamon{3/4%tsp}, @vanilla extract{1%tsp}, @heavy cream or milk{1%tbsp}, and @?raisins{2%tbsp}(finely chopped)